## Method and caveats

- Scope 3 covers purchased materials, upstream transport and business travel only. It does not include emissions from the use of products we sell.
- The 2023 baseline was restated in 2025 after supplier data improved.
- The inventory follows the GHG Protocol and has not yet been externally assured.
- Scope 2 is reported on a market-based basis, which reflects our renewable electricity contracts.
